# ============================================
# IMPORTANT: BEFORE DEPLOYMENT WORKS
# ============================================
#
# 1. RUN DATABASE SCHEMA (Required!)
#    - Go to: https://supabase.com/dashboard/project/wvptkawpgmccgsqjkwls/sql
#    - Click "New Query"
#    - Copy entire content from: SUPABASE_DATABASE_SCHEMA.sql
#    - Paste and click "Run"
#    - Wait for: "Success. No rows returned"
#
# 2. CREATE STORAGE BUCKET (Required!)
#    - Go to: https://supabase.com/dashboard/project/wvptkawpgmccgsqjkwls/storage/buckets
#    - Click "New bucket"
#    - Name: products
#    - Toggle "Public bucket" ON
#    - Click "Create bucket"
#
# 3. CONFIGURE AUTHENTICATION (Required!)
#    - Go to: https://supabase.com/dashboard/project/wvptkawpgmccgsqjkwls/auth/url-configuration
#    - Add your Vercel domain (e.g., your-app.vercel.app)
#    - Add redirect URLs:
#      * https://your-app.vercel.app
#      * https://your-app.vercel.app/**
#    - Click "Save"
#
# 4. ENABLE REALTIME (Recommended)
#    - Go to: https://supabase.com/dashboard/project/wvptkawpgmccgsqjkwls/database/replication
#    - Enable replication for:
#      * products
#      * orders
#      * transactions
#    - Click "Save"
#
# ============================================

# ============================================
# VERCEL DEPLOYMENT STEPS
# ============================================
#
# Step 1: Push to GitHub (Already Done!)
# ----------------------------------------
# Repository: https://github.com/loadingscreen78/LegalFinal-.git
#
# Step 2: Import to Vercel
# -------------------------
# 1. Go to: https://vercel.com/new
# 2. Click "Import Git Repository"
# 3. Select: loadingscreen78/LegalFinal-
# 4. Click "Import"
#
# Step 3: Configure Project
# --------------------------
# Framework Preset: Vite (auto-detected)
# Build Command: npm run build
# Output Directory: dist
# Install Command: npm install
#
# Step 4: Add Environment Variables
# ----------------------------------
# Add the 2 variables from above:
# - VITE_SUPABASE_URL
# - VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY
#
# Make sure to select all environments:
# ✅ Production
# ✅ Preview
# ✅ Development
#
# Step 5: Deploy
# ---------------
# Click "Deploy" and wait 2-3 minutes
#
# Step 6: Test Deployment
# ------------------------
# 1. Visit your deployed URL
# 2. Go to: /supabase-test
# 3. Verify all tests pass ✅
#
# ============================================

# ============================================
# POST-DEPLOYMENT CONFIGURATION
# ============================================
#
# After your first deployment:
#
# 1. Get your Vercel URL (e.g., your-app.vercel.app)
#
# 2. Add it to Supabase:
#    - Go to: https://supabase.com/dashboard/project/wvptkawpgmccgsqjkwls/auth/url-configuration
#    - Add your Vercel URL to "Site URL"
#    - Add to "Redirect URLs":
#      * https://your-app.vercel.app
#      * https://your-app.vercel.app/**
#    - Click "Save"
#
# 3. Test your deployment:
#    - Visit: https://your-app.vercel.app/supabase-test
#    - All tests should pass ✅
#
# ============================================

# ============================================
# TROUBLESHOOTING
# ============================================
#
# Build Fails:
# ------------
# - Check package.json is committed
# - Verify all dependencies are listed
# - Check for TypeScript errors
#
# Environment Variables Not Working:
# -----------------------------------
# - Verify variable names are exact (case-sensitive)
# - Check all environments are selected
# - Redeploy after adding variables
#
# Database Errors:
# ----------------
# - Run SUPABASE_DATABASE_SCHEMA.sql
# - Check tables exist in Supabase Dashboard
#
# Storage Errors:
# ---------------
# - Create 'products' bucket
# - Make sure it's public
# - Check storage policies
#
# Auth Errors:
# ------------
# - Add Vercel domain to Supabase URL Configuration
# - Check redirect URLs are correct
# - Verify email provider is enabled
#
# Real-time Not Working:
# ----------------------
# - Enable replication for tables
# - Check browser console for errors
#
# ============================================

# ============================================
# TESTING CHECKLIST
# ============================================
#
# After deployment, test these features:
#
# Authentication:
# ✅ Sign up new user
# ✅ Verify email
# ✅ Sign in
# ✅ Sign out
# ✅ Admin login with security code
#
# Products:
# ✅ View products (public)
# ✅ Create product (admin)
# ✅ Upload image (admin)
# ✅ Update product (admin)
# ✅ Delete product (admin)
#
# Orders:
# ✅ Add to cart
# ✅ Checkout
# ✅ Place order
# ✅ View orders (user)
# ✅ Track order
# ✅ Download invoice
#
# Admin:
# ✅ View all orders
# ✅ Update order status
# ✅ Set delivery estimate
# ✅ View transactions
# ✅ Revenue statistics
#
# Real-time:
# ✅ Product updates reflect instantly
# ✅ Order updates reflect instantly
# ✅ Transaction updates reflect instantly
#
# ============================================

# ============================================
# SECURITY NOTES
# ============================================
#
# Anon Key (VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY):
# - ✅ Safe to use in frontend
# - ✅ Protected by Row Level Security (RLS)
# - ✅ Can be exposed in client-side code
#
# Service Role Key:
# - ❌ NEVER use in frontend
# - ❌ NEVER commit to Git
# - ❌ Bypasses all RLS policies
# - ✅ Only use in backend/server functions
#
# Row Level Security (RLS):
# - ✅ Enabled on all tables
# - ✅ Users can only see their own data
# - ✅ Admins can see all data
# - ✅ Public can see active products only
#
# ============================================

